The O3DE lighting investigation's animations
============================================

The viewer's Play animation of a demonstration that names one here (`animation` in its file): the values at the
demonstration's time, in seconds. The other demonstrations' are the investigation's code's
(src/o3de/lighting/shot.rs `play_clip`).

$[Import* std]$[Import* render_lab_runtime]$[Import* o3de_lighting_values]

The sphere turns from dielectric to metal and back while its roughness sweeps more slowly.
$[# playSurface {: {^ {t} {' {setSphereMetallic {wave 0.5 0.5 8.0 t}} {setSphereRoughness {wave 0.45 0.35 13.0 t}}}} Animation}]

Roughness walks through the specular cubemap's mips.
$[# playIbl {: {^ {t} {' {setSphereRoughness {cosineWave 0.5 -0.5 12.0 t}}}} Animation}]
